       <p class="lead">"Complex" is a bad name. It suggests these numbers are harder than the ones you already know. They're not &mdash; they're the exact same numbers, plus one new idea: a second axis, running perpendicular to the real number line. Once you see that, most of the syllabus results in this topic stop looking like separate things to memorise and start looking like the same picture, viewed from different angles.</p>
